   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2">Localization</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P10">The page has been localized into all of the languages used in Google Play Listings. There is <text:soft-page-break />a language selector at the top-right of the page populated with the languages you have provided <text:span text:style-name="T8">in the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T9">Publishing</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T10"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T9">App Store</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T10"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T9">Google Play Listing</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T8"> configuration page in the App Builder.</text:span></text:p>
