   <text:p text:style-name="P11">If the user chooses <text:span text:style-name="T2">Show more</text:span> on the language selector, then they can select another language from the complete list of available localizations, but the information in <text:span text:style-name="T2">About this app</text:span> will not be available.\</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2">Verification Code</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P11">Once the user has entered their email address and select the type of deletion, they click the <text:span text:style-name="T2">Send verification code</text:span> button. <text:s />They will receive an email with the code to use.</text:p>
