   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1"><text:soft-page-break />Scriptoria De<text:span text:style-name="T11">le</text:span>te Data Task</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P12">After the end user successfully submits the request using the Data Management Form, a new <text:span text:style-name="T2">Delete Data</text:span> task is assigned to the owner of the project.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P11" />
