   <text:p text:style-name="P11" />
   <text:p text:style-name="P12">The Delete Data task contains a field for email of the <text:span text:style-name="T2">User</text:span> requesting the task, the <text:span text:style-name="T2">Console URL</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12"> of the service holding the information (in this case Firebase), and instructions for performing the task based on whether it is a </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2">Delete Account</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12"> or </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2">Delete Data</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12"> request. There is an option to </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2">Transfer to Admin</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12"> if the owner doesn’t have access to the Firebase account.</text:span></text:p>
